cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "EarEEG-Frontal-Decoder-Repro: experimental code for ear-centred EEG montage, blink-like-transient and LDA/EEGNet decoding analyses"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Amini
    given-names: Ali
repository-code: "https://github.com/AliAmini93/EarEEG-Frontal-Decoder-Repro"
abstract: >-
  Python code for the experimental methods of a manuscript in preparation on ear-centred EEG decoding:
  own-mean montage re-referencing and drop-one montages, label-blind preprocessing, large blink-like frontal
  transient flags, shrinkage LDA and an EEGNet-type network, leave-one-participant-out and joint participant x
  stimulus-group hold-out, train->test regime comparisons on transient-free epochs, and participant-level
  statistics. No data, results or figures are included.
keywords:
  - eeg
  - ear-eeg
  - eegnet
  - research-software
  - reproducible-research
  - python
